<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Planning on Best of AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tags/planning/</link><description>Recent content in Planning on Best of AI</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://bestofai.io/tags/planning/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>planning-with-files</title><link>https://bestofai.io/skills/othmanadi-planning-with-files/</link><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/skills/othmanadi-planning-with-files/</guid><description/></item><item><title>skills</title><link>https://bestofai.io/skills/mattpocock-skills/</link><pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/skills/mattpocock-skills/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This repository bundles the following skills:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;grill-with-docs&lt;/strong&gt;: Runs a planning session that builds a domain model and updates project docs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;triage&lt;/strong&gt;: Moves issues through a defined state machine workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;improve-codebase-architecture&lt;/strong&gt;: Scans a codebase and reports where its architecture could be deepened.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;to-spec&lt;/strong&gt;: Turns a conversation into a written specification for an issue tracker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;to-tickets&lt;/strong&gt;: Breaks a plan into small, ordered tickets with dependencies noted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;implement&lt;/strong&gt;: Builds a feature from a spec using test-driven development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;wayfinder&lt;/strong&gt;: Plans large work as a set of linked decision tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;prototype&lt;/strong&gt;: Builds a throwaway prototype to answer a design question.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;diagnosing-bugs&lt;/strong&gt;: Runs a structured loop for tracking down hard bugs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;research&lt;/strong&gt;: Investigates a question against primary sources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;domain-modeling&lt;/strong&gt;: Builds and refines a project&amp;rsquo;s domain model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;code-review&lt;/strong&gt;: Reviews code against both coding standards and the original spec.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item><item><title>Cal.com</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/cal-com/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/cal-com/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Acuity Scheduling</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/acuity-scheduling/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/acuity-scheduling/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Asana</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/asana-pm/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/asana-pm/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Calendly</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/calendly/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/calendly/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Clockwise</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/clockwise-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/clockwise-ai/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Height</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/height/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/height/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Linear</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/linear/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/linear/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Monday.com</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/monday/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/monday/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Motion</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/motion/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/motion/</guid><description/></item><item><title>Smartsheet AI</title><link>https://bestofai.io/tools/smartsheet-ai/</link><pubDate>Sun, 21 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bestofai.io/tools/smartsheet-ai/</guid><des